\par 
\par \tab }{\b\i\f0\fs24\ul\cf1\cgrid0\insrsid9900160\charrsid9900160 \'a7i\'d2u2}{\f0\fs24\cf1\cgrid0\insrsid9900160\charrsid9900160 :   Ti\'d2n l\'ad\'acng v\'b5 c\'b8c kho\'b6n ph\'f4 c\'cap c\'f1a \'ae\'e5ng ch\'dd Hu\'fanh N\'a8m do c\'ac quan m\'edi tr
\'b6 l\'ad\'acng theo gi\'cay th\'abi tr\'b6 l\'ad\'acng c\'f1a c\'ac quan c\'f2.
\par 
\par \tab }{\b\i\f0\fs24\ul\cf1\cgrid0\insrsid9900160\charrsid9900160 \'a7i\'d2u 3}{\f0\fs24\cf1\cgrid0\insrsid9900160\charrsid9900160 :  Quy\'d5t \'ae\'denh n\'b5y c\'e3 hi\'d6u l\'f9c thi h\'b5nh t\'f5 ng\'b5y k\'fd. T\'e6ng c\'f4c tr\'ad\'ebng T\'e6ng c\'f4
c thu\'d5, L\'b7nh \'ae\'b9o C\'f4c thu\'d5 t\'d8nh Qu\'b6ng nam - \'a7\'b5 n\'bdng, V\'f4 tr\'ad\'ebng V\'f4 T\'e6 ch\'f8c c\'b8n b\'e9 v\'b5 \'a7\'b5o t\'b9o, Ch\'b8nh V\'a8n ph\'dfng B\'e9 T\'b5i ch\'ddnh v\'b5 \'ae\'e5ng ch\'dd Hu\'fanh N\'a8m ch\'de
u tr\'b8ch nhi\'d6m thi h\'b5nh quy\'d5t \'ae\'denh n\'b5y./.
